WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Move a chat to a project and rename it

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:09.545
Click the actions button on the chat you want to move

3
00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:15.315
Choose a project under Move to project

4
00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:21.345
The chat now sits under the chosen project

5
00:00:21.345 --> 00:00:27.625
Choose Rename from the chat menu

6
00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:32.995
Enter the new name

7
00:00:32.995 --> 00:00:35.495
Done
